  "body": "## Purpose\r\nFixes a bug where `response.body` doesn't exist during some portion of the request lifespan (likely when aborted manually)\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\nCheck if both `response` and `response.body` exist before trying to destroy.\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- [ ] I updated readme\r\n- [ ] I added unit test(s)\r\n",
